  "description": "When the tomboy daughter of a newly deceased duke is forced from her home with the rest of her family by a relative they never knew existed, she's determined to correct this injustice and claim her rightful inheritance. Eloise vows to rally support and gather the funds needed to help her mother and sisters, but attempting to earn money as a woman proves to be a challenge. After being accosted in an alley and rescued by a handsome stranger, she cuts off her hair and disguises herself as a boy, deciding to try her hand at being a sailor. But when she sneaks aboard the same vessel as the man who rescued her, Eloise unexpectedly finds herself in a place no highborn young lady is supposed to be: a pirate ship!",
